],"noExpand":true},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h2>ETOPAL ET-A03 Fiber Stripper – Precision Fiber Stripping Tool for Professionals</h2><p>The ETOPAL ET-A03 Fiber Stripper is a high-performance tool engineered for precision in fiber optic cable stripping. Designed for professionals in the telecommunications and networking industries, this tool ensures clean and accurate cable stripping with minimal effort, improving the efficiency and quality of fiber optic installations, splicing, and maintenance. Built with durability and comfort in mind, the ET-A03 is an essential tool for anyone working with fiber optic cables.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><p>Precision Stripping: Strips fiber optic cables cleanly without damaging the core or surrounding coatings, ensuring high-quality results for every task.</p><p>Ergonomic Handle: Soft, non-slip grip reduces hand fatigue, allowing for extended use during long hours without discomfort.</p><p>Durable Construction: Built with premium materials for enhanced durability, making it perfect for frequent use in both field and workshop environments.</p><p>Versatile Compatibility: Suitable for various fiber optic cable types, including single-mode and multi-mode cables, and works with tight-buffered and loose-tube cables.</p><p>Compact and Lightweight: Portable design ensures easy handling and storage, making it ideal for technicians working in the field.</p><h3>Specifications:</h3><ul><li>Model: ET-A03</li><li>Cable Compatibility: Single-mode, Multi-mode, Tight-buffered, Loose-tube cables</li><li>Material: High-quality carbon steel (blades) and ABS plastic (handle)</li><li>Blade Type: Precision, hardened steel blades for clean cuts</li><li>Stripping Range: 125 µm to 900 µm fiber optic cables</li><li>Dimensions: 6.3 inches (L) x 2.1 inches (W) x 0.7 inches (H)</li><li>Weight: 150 grams (lightweight for portability)</li><li>Handle Type: Ergonomic, non-slip handle for comfort and control</li><li>Color: Black and yellow (for high visibility)</li><li>Usage: Suitable for fiber optic installation, maintenance, and repairs</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Signal Fire Mc-16 Fiber Stripper Multi-Functions with Fiber Cleaver","href":"/signal-fire-mc-16-fiber-stripper-multi-functions-with-fiber-cleaver","now":"25,000৳","old":"27,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Signal Fire ZSQ-09 New 9 in 1 Optical Fiber Stripper Optic Miller Scissors Wire Pliers","href":"/signal-fire-zsq-09-new-9-in-1-optical-fiber-stripper-optic-miller-scissors-wire-pliers","now":"2,500৳","old":"2,750৳","single":""},{"name":"ZTI Tri-hole Fiber Optic Stripper","href":"/zti-tri-hole-fiber-optic-stripper","now":"","old":"","single":"1,000৳"},{"name":"TAWAA FT11301T Fiber Optic Stripper","href":"/tawaa-ft11301t-fiber-optic-stripper","now":"","old":"","single":"1,700৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/etopel-et-20-optical-fiber-cleaver","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Etopel/Cleaver/ET-20/ET-20-500x500-3-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"ETOPEL ET-20 Optical Fiber Cleaver","width":100,"height":100},"name":"ETOPEL ET-20 Optical Fiber Cleaver","now":"","old":"","single":"5,300৳","tax":"Ex Tax:5,300৳","out":false}]},"tags":{"title":"Tags:","links":[{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=ETOPEL%20ET-A03","text":"ETOPEL ET-A03"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=Fiber%20Stripper","text":"Fiber Stripper"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=Fiber%20Optic%20Stripper","text":"Fiber Optic Stripper"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=Precision%20Stripper","text":"Precision Stripper"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/sea